# DEPRECATED: Legacy Win32 GUI Driver

## Status
This directory contains the legacy Win32-native GUI driver (`taseditor`, `directx`, `res.rc`, etc.) and the embedded `zlib` copy.

As of Phase 6 of the FCEUX11 Construction Plan, this entire directory tree is **deprecated** and **no longer participates in the build**.

## Rationale
- FCEUX11 is a Windows 11 exclusive derivative that uses the Qt6 driver (`src/drivers/Qt/`) as its sole UI layer.
- The embedded `zlib` has been replaced by the system/vcpkg-provided zlib to eliminate ~700 K&R-style definition warnings and reduce maintenance burden.
- The legacy Win32 code is unmaintained and duplicates functionality already provided by the Qt6 driver.

## Retention Period
This directory is preserved in the repository for reference and to satisfy license history requirements under GPLv2. It may be physically removed in a future release once the Qt6 driver has proven stable for several release cycles.

## Date of Deprecation
2026-05-17
